DERIVED_NOT_INHERITED (an artifact whose records ALL validate, plus a structurally perfect hand-written `malformedRecords` entry carrying INJECTED-PAYLOAD: the read reports NO quarantine and carries no `malformedRecords` key at all, no corruption notice is rendered, and a read-then-write round trip leaves the on-disk `records` array byte-identical — the payload never reaches gate evidence. Same for a records-less envelope. Detector proven to discriminate an injected array from a clean one)
NON_ARRAY_CLASSIFICATION_IS_TOTAL (6 non-array values planted under `malformedRecords` — object, string, number, null, boolean, nested-array-lookalike — each read, gate-evaluated, rendered, written and re-read with no raw builtin escaping, no quarantine reported, no corruption notice, no refusal, and the on-disk records untouched; the string case in particular no longer iterates as its own characters)
JUNK_ENTRIES_NEITHER_CRASH_NOR_INJECT (15 malformed quarantine-entry shapes — including a null entry, a missing/float/negative/out-of-range/string `index`, a missing `value` whose restore would serialise as a bare null record, duplicate indices, and a prototype-inherited entry — each read, gate-evaluated, rendered, written and re-read with no raw builtin escaping, nothing accepted as classification, nothing injected, and no refusal)
GENUINE_QUARANTINE_UNREGRESSED (a genuinely malformed v1 record at index 0 and at index 1, each with no plant, with a planted INJECTED-PAYLOAD entry and with a junk string plant: exactly ONE quarantined record is derived every time — the real one, verbatim, at its on-disk index, with the plant REPLACED rather than merged — the corruption notice names it, the original survives the write verbatim and in place, the derived key is not persisted, and the next read re-derives the same quarantine. The acceptance rule kept 100% of the derived entries, so the junk rejected above was rejected for being junk)
CLASSIFICATION_IS_HONOURED_BY_PROVENANCE_NOT_SHAPE (a hand-built `RedEvidenceData` carrying a structurally PERFECT `malformedRecords` entry — the cross-host reviewer's own reproduction — is reported as zero quarantined records and is REFUSED by the write boundary rather than crashed on, silently accepted, or injected: neither the direct guard nor `store.writeRedEvidence` puts INJECTED-PAYLOAD into `records`, and the on-disk artifact is untouched. Controls: the GENUINELY derived payload from a real read is still accepted by the same call and still restores its quarantined original in place, while a BYTE-IDENTICAL JSON copy of that same payload is not — so the rule provably reads provenance and not the bytes. Its documented LIMIT is pinned too: bytes self-classified through the exported `classifyRedEvidenceArtifact` are accepted, and reproduce the caller's own array verbatim — no record the caller did not already supply)
red-b2aa7-quarantine-derivation: OK (`malformedRecords` is strictly derived and never inherited: an on-disk value is stripped at the read boundary in every outcome, is never honoured as classification, and can never be re-inserted into the `records` array the live gates read; non-array and junk values crash neither the read, the gate pair, the operator notice nor the write; and a genuinely malformed record is still quarantined, retained and re-derived)
